## Open CASCADE Technology (OCCT)

Gusset makes use of facilities provided by the Open CASCADE Technology software.

- **License:** GNU Lesser General Public License version 2.1 with the Open CASCADE
  exception version 1.0. The full texts ship as `LICENSE_LGPL_21.txt` and
  `OCCT_LGPL_EXCEPTION.txt`, next to `NOTICE-OCCT.md`.
- **How it is used:** OCCT is **not** part of the Gusset executables. It is shipped
  unmodified as separate shared libraries (`TK*.dll` on Windows next to the programs,
  `lib/gusset/libTK*.so*` on Linux, `Contents/Frameworks` on macOS) and linked
  dynamically, so you can replace them with your own build.
- **Source code:** the exact version shipped is listed in `NOTICE-OCCT.md` (tag and
  commit), together with the build recipe (`build-occt.sh`) and how to rebuild and
  relink. Every Gusset release also carries the corresponding OCCT source archive as a
  release asset.

